"Steam Community :: AION 2 (https://steamcommunity.com/app/3393110/allnews/?l=english)\nciteturn7search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 6 days ago; Is AION 2 subscription based?\nWe encourage players to join new servers as they become available. Server transfers will be available in the future and you'll have a chance to rejoin your friends at that time.\n\nAs a reminder, all instanced content including dungeons are available cross-server!\n\nAION 2\n\n194\n\n45\n\nLaunch FAQ\n\nSep 30\n\nIs AION 2 subscription based? \nAION 2 is free to play with an optional monthly membership. \n\n \n\nWhat is the monetization of AION 2? \nAION 2 offers optional paid cosmetic items, a Battle Pass and a membership to access player-driven economy & currency exchanges. You can check out how the monetization for AION 2 Global looks in detail here[aion2.plaync.com]. \n\n \n\nCan I play this game even if I have no one to play with? \nYes, AION 2 can be played solo or with friends!  \n\n \n\nAre there any differences between the Steam and Purple versions? \nNo, the in-game content is the same for both Steam and Purple users. \n\n \n\nWill any progress from the TW or KR version of the game carry over? \nNo, any progress between the TW/KR and global version will not carry over. \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAre you going to pay for Special Quai Membership every month? :: AION 2 General Discussion (https://steamcommunity.com/app/3393110/discussions/1/583935357196846286/)\nciteturn7search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; AION 2 ... Do you know if this game is at least somehow playable as f2p or does it limit you in many ways compared to subscription ?\n\nAION 2\n\nAll Discussions Screenshots Artwork Broadcasts Videos News Guides Reviews\n\n### AION 2\n\nStore Page\n\nImage\n\n侍Kage Image: has AION 2\n\nSep 28 @ 12:08am\n\n ImageReport this post\n\nAre you going to pay for Special Quai Membership every month?\n\nSpecial Quai Membership 