-------------------\nSubscription \"Per Server\" NOT Account wide. :: AION 2 Essential Info & Resources (https://steamcommunity.com/app/3393110/discussions/6/583935635494124713/)\nciteturn7search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; AION 2 ... Subscription \"Per Server\" NOT Account wide.\n\nAION 2\n\nAll Discussions Screenshots Artwork Broadcasts Videos News Guides Reviews\n\n### AION 2\n\nSep 30 @ 5:12pm\n\n ImageReport this post\n\nSubscription \"Per Server\" NOT Account wide.\n\nIf you need to create characters on more than one server (joining friends, just want to try/have characters on both factions); The subscription you purchase will only work on one of those servers, otherwise you will have to pay double. So not $15mo but at least $30mo for the sub, not to mention if you have multiple characters on multiple servers. This is not even a choice as you can only have ONE faction per a specific server (no way to have both on one). Subscriptions are \"Server Bound\", NOT \"Account Bound\". Can't recall any other game that does this. If I pay a sub for WoW I can play both Alliance AND Horde if I want. Same with any other MMO. What gives? This needs to change. Also cosmetics we pay for should also be Account Bound, but they are not. This is also a major issue. I do not mind spending money on a product I enjoy, but when things are this blatantly predatory it is a huge turn off to the game/makes me spend less.\n**Update**\nGood news, the founders items are now going to be available on all characters account wide.\nHopefully they keep it up and correct purchased cosmetics / pets (mounts) and the Subscription.\n\nLast edited by ﹺ; Oct 3 @ 1:28pm\n\nShowing 1-15 of 87 comments\n\nThomas_mfq Image: has AION 2\n\nOct 1 @ 1:09am \n\n ImageReport this post\n\nYes, this needs to be delt with. I understand the founders pack rewards not being shared across different accounts is very reasonable, but this is not.\n\n\nIchiban Image: has AION 2\n\nOct 1 @ 1:15am \n\n ImageReport